sequenceDiagram
    actor Owner as Владелец
    participant Project as Existing project page
    participant UI as Branding page/editor
    participant API as GET/PATCH branding
    participant Auth as currentAccountId
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Public as Form / Wall / Widget
    Owner->>Project: Обычный login и owned project
    Project-->>Owner: Ссылка Оформление стены
    Owner->>UI: Открыть /dashboard/slug/branding
    UI->>Auth: Проверить session
    Auth-->>UI: accountId
    UI->>DB: withAccount; SELECT owned active branding
    Note over UI,DB: app_authenticated + owner GUC на фактическом SELECT
    DB-->>UI: canonical settings + owned page metadata
    Owner->>UI: Изменить dirty keys и Save
    Note over UI: Validate; capture draft/payload; disable все settings + Save
    UI-->>Owner: Pending status вне fieldset; focus; aria-busy
    UI->>API: PATCH JSON + browser Origin
    API->>Auth: Проверить session до чтения body
    Auth-->>API: accountId
    Note over API: Origin / type / actual bytes / whitelist validation
    API->>DB: BEGIN; withAccount; SELECT FOR UPDATE
    Note over API,DB: app_authenticated + owner GUC на SELECT и UPDATE
    API->>DB: UPDATE branding = branding || validated patch
    DB-->>API: RETURNING branding; COMMIT
    API-->>UI: 200 canonical settings
    UI-->>Owner: Canonical; dirty очищены; unlock; focus saved status
    Owner->>Public: Reload public surfaces
    Public->>DB: Server-resolved active project; approved/project filters
    DB-->>Public: Settings и разрешённые данные
    Public-->>Owner: Реальный theme/order/label/accent/logo/heading effect
    Owner->>UI: Назад в проект
    UI-->>Owner: Тот же owned project URL
